<h1>Watchlist Pattern &amp; Correlation Analysis (June 14 - July 20, 2026)</h1>

<p>This report presents the EOD price-tracking audit of all watchlist candidates from the starting date of <strong>June 14, 2026</strong> to today, <strong>July 20, 2026</strong>. In total, <strong>2188 candidates</strong> were analyzed across <strong>781 completed swing trades</strong> (excluding untriggered or active trades).</p>

