<h2>1. Confirmed Rule: Industry Category Dominance</h2>
<p>The weekly industry category remains the single strongest predictor of success across the entire dataset. Breakouts in Leading/Emerging sectors exhibit high edge, while Unscaled sectors show high failure rates.</p>

